<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Bryan Fury (Left Side) Taunt Jet

This macro is designed to perform combos in a game called Tekken 7 and Tekken 8 with a single button.

To do this technique, you need to be to the left of your opponent and the control should be set by default with the shift settings like mine:

Movements are W,A ,S ,D

1=J 2=I 3=K 4=L

The macro has been tested in numerous online battles. Problems can only be due to your unstable Internet connection with the enemy, as well as this macro works only at a stable frame rate of 59-60 fps.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
